76 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (Medicaps University is one of the leading private universities in Central India. Since its inception, the institution has consistently aimed at creating an ideal ambience for budding technocrats and helps them to grow like true professionals. We have an optimal blend of academic brilliance and industry exposure. This has helped us in refining the candidature of our graduating students from the engineering, management, agriculture, commerce, science, pharmacy, arts, humanities and social sciences, law, allied and healthcare, and journalism and mass communication field for the last 26 years.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
77 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 47 0 R
/T (The Faculty of Engineering at Medicaps University offers a range of undergraduate and postgraduate programs that are designed to equip students with the skills and knowledge needed to succeed in the competitive world of engineering.)
/E (The Faculty of Engineering at Medicaps University offers a range of undergraduate and postgraduate programs that are designed to equip students with the skills and knowledge needed to succeed in the competitive world of engineering.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
78 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (Our undergraduate program includes B.Tech degrees in various specializations. Our postgraduate program includes M.Tech degrees in Computer Science and Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Civil Engineering, Electronics and Communication, Information Technology and integrated M.Tech in CSE. With a focus on experiential learning and industry exposure, our programs provide students with the opportunity to work on real-world projects and gain hands-on experience in their field. Graduates from our programs have gone on to excel in a range of industries, including IT, manufacturing, construction, and telecommunications.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
